    "summary": "Slip catalogue:\r\nFlute formed of a complete joint of bamboo closed at both ends. It has three holes, two near one end and the third near the other, ornamented by four compartments of diagonal zig-zag in the natural bark, the background (cut away) being brown. These compartments are separated by bands of the natural bark ornamented by incised herringbone and zig-zag pattern.",
